{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-12","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-12-talk-403810926-line","text":"星际和平公司的董事会理事「疤眼夫人」坐在你对面，她的左眼有一道狭长的疤，你感受到她正观察你。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-12-talk-403810927-line","text":"「你回来了。我知道我不会等太久。」她看到你，双手交叉靠在下颚，丝毫不感到意外。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-12-talk-403810928-line","text":"「天使型谢债发行机，定期把口袋里的金币喂给它。它会记录你的投资。周期结束，它会给你数十倍的回馈。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-12-text-5769756601977369696-choice","text":"索求一份更*定制化*的投资计划。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-12-text-2677161913758413130-effect","text":"你希望投资未来……","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-12-text-8972167857162033310-choice","text":"我买了。","speaker":""}]}
